Package: tcrClustR
Title: Define TCR "Families" via similarity metrics
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("GW", "McElfresh", ,"mcelfreg@ohsu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1948-7571"))
Description: This package uses network analysis from different TCR distance metrics to group TCRs into hopefully functional families for prioritization in synthesis studies. 
